@startuml Linkwise_Chat_Components
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
title UML component view: messaging above station execution (proposed)
[ChatGPT Agent / Codex host] as Agent
[Messaging MCP adapter] as MCP
[Message application service] as Service
[Address directory +\nroute evaluator] as Routes
[Durable inbox / outbox /\nreceipt journal] as Store
[Station policy] as Policy
[Contact scheduler] as Scheduler
[Station execution service] as Exec
[Qualified modem adapter] as Modem
[Optional supported\nWinlink client adapter] as Winlink
Agent --> MCP : send / read / status / events
MCP --> Service : typed commands
Service -left-> Store : atomic acceptance /\ndeduplication
Service -right-> Routes : eligible route evidence
Service --> Scheduler : bounded delivery intent
Scheduler -left-> Policy : eligibility / budgets
Scheduler --> Exec : existing prepare / grant /\nstart contract
Exec --> Modem : local link lifecycle
Exec -right-> Winlink : distinct service route
Modem --> Service : complete bytes / transport\nevidence
Winlink --> Service : service-specific evidence
note bottom of Service
A contact scheduler executes installed policy, not a
competing AI planner.
A link ACK, relay custody and final inbox receipt
are distinct evidence.
All chat components are proposed; existing radio MCP
is separate.
end note
@enduml
